── WEIGHT SWEEP (#334) (each shipped weight x0 / x2 -> top-10 ENTRANTS minus the names they DISPLACED, realized fwd %) ──
  a weight never gates, so an equal-weight book feels it ONLY through the names it swaps across the edge (#149).
  RE-PROBE needs mean AND median positive and means a full A/B round, never a weight move. k/N = buckets that swapped.
