backtest: PIT — the index pond is now 1206 names that were EVER in the S&P 500, not the ~503 that survived to today
backtest: 1360 tickers, WALK-FORWARD scoring every ~6mo with a 12y forward holdout each (MAX monthly history)…
backtest: verdict NOT journaled — a POINT-IN-TIME run measures a different pool than the screen ranks, so its number must not overwrite the footer's; re-run without `pit` to journal
backtest: SIZED record NOT journaled — a `pit` run without `dead` scores survivors only; add `dead` to journal it